OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA clear, dry 
OL,6,Fand cold night for most places, with   
OL,7,Flight winds. Any coastal showers will  
OL,8,Fstay offshore. This will allow a       
OL,9,Fwidespread frost to develop, with the  
OL,10,Fodd patch of freezing mist and fog to  
OL,11,Fform.                                  
OL,13,CSaturday:FA cold and clear day, any    
OL,14,Ffreezing fog patches slowly clearing   
OL,15,Fduring the morning. The wind will      
OL,16,Fremain light.                          
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
