OL,3,GNorth East                             
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:         
OL,6,FRemaining cold and mostly clear on     
OL,7,FSunday and Monday, with isolated       
OL,8,Fshowers on Sunday. Cloudier and        
OL,9,Fbreezier by Tuesday, with outbreaks of 
OL,10,Frain and hill snow.                    
